				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Comparuit apud nos dilectus frater <persName ref="p4841">Ioannes <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Fridinger</persName>, presentium lator, ac conditionis sue rationem nobis recitavit, quomodo prete<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ritis comitiis <placeName ref="l21">Badensibus</placeName> causante nonnullam fructuum penuriam <persName ref="p7763">archimandrita</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>in <placeName ref="l152">Vischingen</placeName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Abt der Benediktinerabtei <placeName ref="l152">Fischingen</placeName> war von 1540-1553 <persName ref="p7763">Markus Schenkli</persName>, s. <bibl source="b300">Helvetia Sacra</bibl> III/1 1, S. 697f.</note> benefitio suo sit destitutus,<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Der Abt hatte sich mehrfach darüber beschwert, in <placeName ref="l1905">Bettwiesen</placeName> und <placeName ref="l3612">Au</placeName> Prädikanten unterhalten zu müssen, obwohl es sich nur um Filialen handle, worauf die katholischen Orte am 20. April (Donnerstag vor St. Georg) <persName ref="p4841">Fridingers</persName> Entlassung beschlossen; s. <bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1d 81 d4. 93 f2. 107 i; Willy <bibl source="b342">Keller</bibl>, Die Benediktinerabtei Fischingen im Zeitalter der Glaubensspaltung und der katholischen Reform 1500-1700, Freiburg/Schweiz 1946. - ZSKG, Beiheft 3, S. 76f.</note> quamvis ecclesia sua multis modis renixa <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>fuerit, proposuitque a fratribus persuasus se recepturum sub ditionem vestram sperans <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>aliquam functionem ipsi apud <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinos</placeName> contingere posse, quo ipsi ac liberis suis<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Nicht namentlich bekannt.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>de victu et amictu facilius provisum sit<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p4841">Fridinger</persName> wurde 1542 Pfarrer in <placeName ref="l71">Buchs</placeName> (<placeName ref="l803">Kt. Zürich</placeName>), s. Pfarrerbuch 14. 282.</note>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Id autem ipsi consultum esse putavit, ut, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>si literas testimoniales sue ante acte vite ac conversationis a fratribus suis ipsi notis <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>secum ferret, ut tu (optime patrone), pius magistratus ac patritii omnes certificarentur <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ob nullam aliam culpam sive delictum ipsum ecclesie sue esse exemp<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>tum quam ob predictam causam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Indubitato etiam insignis patritius vester ac legatus <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>M. <persName ref="p1419">Ioannes Hab</persName><note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">Hab <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> fratris huius rationem omnem tibi exposuit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Rogavitque nos, qui eius notitiam <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>iam ad multos annos habuerimus, ut huiusmodi testimonii literas ipsi comunicare non <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>detrectaremus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Fatemur igitur fratrem illum conversatum esse intra nos citra <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>omnem offensam, quantum nobis constat, et non<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Vor</hi> non <hi>gestrichenes</hi> quod.</note> aliter a vicinioribus suis symmistis <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ac subditis percepimus<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>Undeutlich korr. aus</hi> perceperimus[?].</note>, quam quod bene ecclesie sue prefuerit et exemplo et doctrina <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>dignus quidem, ut pio coetui<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> cetui.</note> ac cordato prefitiatur; non enim dubitamus, quin <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>boni ac eruditi pastoris numeros omnes sit suppleturus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Hunc ergo tibi (clarissim<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>e vir) comendamus non ambigentes, quicquid benefitii in ipsum collocaveris, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>in Christum ipsum collocatum esse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><persName ref="p8171">Theodorum Bibliandrum</persName> piosque omnes nobis saluta.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Date ac magistri Alexandri sigillo munite 25. aprilis anno 1542.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/><persName ref="p8483">Huldrichus Amantius</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>M. <persName ref="p6459">Alexander Schmutz</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName ref="p8007">Ioannes Fabricius</persName>.<pb type="edition" next="74"/></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Spectatissimo viro ac <placeName ref="l587">Tigurine</placeName> ecclesie <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ornatissimo presuli M. <persName ref="p495">Hainrico <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, domino nostro ac patro<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>no in primis observando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
